ll maintained, management is responsive, and being able to walk to the MRT was a huge draw for my tenants. Facilities aren’t super high-end compared to Mont Kiara condos, but they’re practical and clean. Biggest drawback is it’s leasehold, so for long-term buyers that might matter. For rental though, it’s been easy to attract tenants.\n\n(328 Reviews)\n\n22 September 2025\n\nFamily Perspective\n\nWe’ve been here with our two kids for over a year. The place feels safe, security guards are attentive, and the pool and gym are decent enough for daily use. Having shops and eateries downstairs makes life convenient, but sometimes the retail area brings more people around, so it can feel crowded. Still, overall it’s a comfortable home for a small family.\n\n(328 Reviews)\n\n22 September 2025\n\nCommuter Resident\n\nLiving at D’Sara Sentral has been a lifesaver for me because of the sky bridge straight to the MRT. I work in KL and don’t need to drive every day, which cuts down so much stress. The unit is modern and easy to maintain. The only thing is, for Sungai Buloh the price is on the higher side, but I guess you’re really paying for the connectivity.\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nHouse for Sale - Studio at D'sara Sentral, Jun 2026 (https://www.propertyguru.com.my/property-for-sale/at-d-sara-sentral-5885/with-studio)\nciteturn193search11 [wordlim: 200] Published: 5 months ago; Crawled: 3 months ago; RM 650,000 RM 722.22 psf D'sara Sentral Jalan Welfare Off Jalan Sungai Buloh, Sungai Buloh, Selangor Studio 2 900 sqft (floor), 900 sqft (land)Service Residence Leasehold Built: 2018 MRT 6 min (480 m) from Kampung Selamat Listed on May 06, 2026 (1mo ago)Contact Agent WhatsApp WhatsApp ... Some of the best known restaurants nearby D'Sara Sentral are: Deli Mad 19 Cafe Jeff Lee Kitchen Restoran Tai Soon Curry House Roast Goose Prabu Restaurant Tree Steak House Sg Buloh Restoran Seafood Huaw Kee Listed in the 2016 Top 10 Developers in Malaysia by Wonderlist, Mah Sing Group holds a 20-year track record as a leading property developer in the country. ... No. of floors 504\n\nGrace Ng\n\nImage: chevron-left-f\n\nImage: chevron-right-f\n\n22\n\nRM 650,000 RM 722.22 psf D'sara Sentral Jalan Welfare Off Jalan Sungai Buloh, Sungai Buloh, Selangor Studio 2 900 sqft (floor), 900 sqft (land)Service Residence Leasehold Built: 2018 MRT 6 min (480 m) from Kampung Selamat Listed on May 06, 2026 (1mo ago)Contact Agent WhatsApp WhatsApp\n\nImage: illustration\n\nWe’ve shown you all the matches\n\nAlmost there!\n\nRefining your recommendations.\n\nThis may take a few seconds...\n\nImage: Image\n\nD'sara Sentral\n\nJalan Welfare Off Jalan Sungai Buloh 40160 Sungai Buloh\n\n5(7)\n\nSummary\n\nD’ Sara Sentral is the latest residential cum commercial lot developed by Mah Sing Group. Located in the rapidly expanding luxury residential area of Sungai Buloh, this leasehold property was completed by Mah Sing Group in 2018. The serviced residence will take up four blocks in the D'Sara Sentral development. Initially an industrial area with few residential properties, efforts by several developers began moulding Sungai Buloh into a luxury residential area, keenly following the footsteps of its neighbouring city, Damansara. While close to the industrial area, the nearest factory is about 10 km away in Subang Bestari; therefore, residents do not have to worry about pollution or noise caused by industrial activity. This is in strict accordance with the guidelines set by the Malaysian Department of Environment (DOE) with a minimum buffer of 1 km from high-risk industrial areas. The D’sara Sentral will be a midpoint to many amenities in the Sungai Buloh area – mainly the Sungai Buloh Hospital, Subang Airport, and the residence can be accessed via Guthrie Corridor Expressway, Federal highway, Elmina Highway, Selayang Kepong highway and NKVE highway. Additionally, the Kampung Selamat MRT station will be a mere 5 minutes walk away, linked through a direct bridge from the property. D’Sara Sentral building complex is made up of six blocks – consisting of four apartment blocks, one retail shopping centre and one SoVo suite space. There are many shopping malls within driving distance, such as The Store, Perdana Shopping Centre, Tropics Shopping Center, SB Mall, Kompleks Sungai Buloh and others. Some of the best known restaurants nearby D'Sara Sentral are: Deli Mad 19 Cafe Jeff Lee Kitchen Restoran Tai Soon Curry House Roast Goose Prabu Restaurant Tree Steak House Sg Buloh Restoran Seafood Huaw Kee Listed in the 2016 Top 10 Developers in Malaysia by Wonderlist, Mah Sing Group holds a 20-year track record as a leading property developer in the country. This property will be an integrated space of the serviced residences , SoVo (Smart Office, Virtual Office) suites and retail shops. Mah Sing Group is currently undertaking several exciting projects of the like such as M Residence 2 @ Rawang, Lakeville Residence @ Taman Wahyu and Sutera Avenue @ Kota Kinabalu. The serviced apartments are priced at a starting value of RM 630,000 to RM 890,000. Prized at RM 700 psf, Mah Sing is offering a 9% rebate as well as a 1% down payment scheme, with 1-year free maintenance fee. The SoVo suites are priced at a starting value of RM 390,000 to RM 680,000, while the retail units are priced between RM 1,100 to RM 1,500 per sq ft. The maintenance fee is set at the customary RM 0.35 per sq ft. Other properties within Sungai Buloh worth taking a further look into are Aman Court Apartment @ Seri Aman Heights, Astana Mutiara, Astana Putra, Dahlia Apartment (Saujana Utama) and Iris Apartment (Saujana Utama).\n\nProject details\n\nType Service Residence\n\nPrice RM 245K - 790K\n\nCompletion year 2018\n\nTenure Leasehold\n\nNo. of blocks 1\n\nNo. of floors 504\n\nTotal units 247\n\n\nDeveloper Mah Sing Group Berhad\n\nView project\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n